# Pull requests

When asked to open a pull request or merge request in this project:

- Create a real, ready-for-review pull request. Do not open a draft.
- If the work resolves a GitHub issue, include `Closes #<number>` in the pull request body so merging closes that issue.
- Use the GitHub CLI (`gh pr create`) against this repository. Do not pass `--draft`.

```markdown
## Summary
- What changed and why.

## Test plan
- [ ] How to verify the fix

Closes #182
```
